  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that RNA-only singleprofile with PCA encoding achieves 0.48 validation accuracy. This experiment tests multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (same RNA encoder, no image encoder), isolating the effect of profile settings and aggregation. It balances exploration of multiprofile (which may capture more data) with a simple aggregation method, avoiding simultaneous changes to multiple components. This clarifies whether multiprofile or aggregation improves performance, both critical design choices with limited prior evidence."
